  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/418f56abc640a0f997.png\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מִלִּים מִתְחַבְּרוֹת<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּהֲגִיָּה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תֵּבוֹת מִשְׁתַּלְּבוֹת<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּמַנְגִּינָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כַּפְתּוֹר וָפֶרַח,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מְשֻׁקָּדִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">פֶּרֶץ וָזֶרַח<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תְּאוֹמִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'מוֹצִיא מַצָּה'<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'אוֹכֵל קֻרְצָא'<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עִבְרִית יָפֶה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לָשׁוֹן&nbsp;נָאָה.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><span data-end=\"167\" data-start=\"145\"><div><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מִדֵּי פַּעַם, מְצָא רֶגַע קָטָן לְהָמִיר מִלָּה רְגִילָה בְּמִלָּה עִבְרִית נָאָה שֶׁשָּׁכַחְנוּ לְהִשְׁתַּמֵּשׁ בָּהּ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא כְּדֵי לְהַרְשִׁים - אֶלָּא כְּדֵי לְחַדֵּשׁ&nbsp;צֶבַע שֶׁדָּהָה.</span></p></div></span><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p>גַּם לְמִלָּה פְּשׁוּטָה יֵשׁ הָדָר - יָפְיָהּ בָּא מִבְּהִירוּתָהּ, לֹא מִן נְדִירוּתָהּ.</p></span></div><div><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"<i><b>זהב וכסף ונחשת</b></i>\":<br />ראשי תיבות של הימים בהם קוראים בתורה:<br /><b>ז</b>' (שבת)<br /><b>ה</b>' (חמישי בשבוע)<br /><b>ב</b>' (שני בשבוע)<br /><b>כ</b>' (כיפורים)<br /><b>ס</b>' (סוכות)<br /><b>פ</b>' (פורים, פסח)<br /><b>נ</b>' (נרות [חנוכה])<br /><b>ח</b>' (חודש [ראש חודש ובכללו ראש השנה])<br /><b>ש</b>' (שבועות, שמחת תורה)<br /><b>ת</b>' (תעניות)</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">(בשם החת\"ם סופר)</span></span></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span><b style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;</span></b></p></span><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b>פֶרַח</b>' / '<b style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שׁוֹשָׁן</span></b>'<br /></span></span>❖ שושנה - הפרח האולטימטיבי</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תְּרוּמָה</span></b>' / '<b style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אַפְרָשׁוּתָא</span></b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;נתינה - הפרשה</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְיָצַקְתָּ</span></b>' / '<b style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְתַתֵּיךְ</span></b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ יציקה, המסה - התכה</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּמַלְקָחֶיהָ</span></b>' / '<b style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְצֵיבְתַהָא</span></b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;מלקחיים - צבתות</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'<b style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לָשֵׂאת</span></b>' / '<b style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לְמִטַּל</span></b>'<br /><span><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ להרים - לִטֹּל</span></span></span></span></li></ol><span><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><br /></span></h2><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"float: right; margin-left: 1em; text-align: right;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/20e9c9426c4033575f.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"clear: right; display: inline !important; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1536\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" src=\"/assets/images/content/20e9c9426c4033575f.png\" width=\"133\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">השפה העתיקה <br />לא מפסיקה להתחדש</span></td></tr></tbody></table></span><br /><br /></div></div>"
}
